{"about_the_game":"Goblin Colony is a real-time strategy game with building and settlement management features. As the keeper of the dungeon you will command an ambitious tribe of goblins as you dig, build and explore the depths of the mountain. Take control as you battle the dwarves and other creatures for supremacy across a huge campaign!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your colony</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276800/extras/38a79489471fd514399e63c13a3e4826.poster.avif?t=1757201735\" width=608 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276800/extras/38a79489471fd514399e63c13a3e4826.webm?t=1757201735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276800/extras/38a79489471fd514399e63c13a3e4826.mp4?t=1757201735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Expand your underground dungeon and shape it the way you want.<br>Build a stronghold with rooms such as treasury, barracks and more.<br>Place torches to light the way forward.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dig to explore</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276800/extras/7ff561b733b9ea77b971a8c01147074f.poster.avif?t=1757201735\" width=608 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276800/extras/7ff561b733b9ea77b971a8c01147074f.webm?t=1757201735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276800/extras/7ff561b733b9ea77b971a8c01147074f.mp4?t=1757201735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Tunnel your way through the dungeon in search of gold.<br>Cross rivers of water by building bridges.<br>Watch out for dangerous foes such as mutant rats and giant flying bats.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage the goblins</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276800/extras/4a232dacdaca925d0220cd04aca384ed.poster.avif?t=1757201735\" width=608 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276800/extras/4a232dacdaca925d0220cd04aca384ed.webm?t=1757201735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276800/extras/4a232dacdaca925d0220cd04aca384ed.mp4?t=1757201735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Supply your goblins according to their needs such as beds for sleep and food for hunger.<br>Research new technologies to help in your progress.<br>Enlist goblins as warriors to fight the enemy.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle the enemy</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276800/extras/f795e1b5bae8788cfadd7c7fb8c76c02.poster.avif?t=1757201735\" width=608 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276800/extras/f795e1b5bae8788cfadd7c7fb8c76c02.webm?t=1757201735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276800/extras/f795e1b5bae8788cfadd7c7fb8c76c02.mp4?t=1757201735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Fight the dwarves and monsters for supremacy.<br>Build siege weapons to defend your base.<br>Achieve victory through superior numbers or cunning tactics.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Feautures</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">  <li> Real-time strategy suited for both casual and hardcore players<br>  </li><li> Huge 15+ maps campaign<br>  </li><li> Skirmish mode with randomized maps<br>  </li><li> Usermade maps<br></li><li> Level editor included!</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2276800?t=1757201735","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2276800?t=1757201735","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276800/56c49b63a29ac088d16d7559fe01ebfa305997f0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757201735","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276800/56c49b63a29ac088d16d7559fe01ebfa305997f0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757201735","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3525090,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"Goblin Colony is a real-time strategy game with building and settlement management features. As the keeper of the dungeon you will command an ambitious tribe of goblins as you dig, build and explore the depths of the mountain. Take control as you battle the dwarves and other creatures for supremacy across a huge campaign!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your colony</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276800/extras/38a79489471fd514399e63c13a3e4826.poster.avif?t=1757201735\" width=608 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276800/extras/38a79489471fd514399e63c13a3e4826.webm?t=1757201735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276800/extras/38a79489471fd514399e63c13a3e4826.mp4?t=1757201735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Expand your underground dungeon and shape it the way you want.<br>Build a stronghold with rooms such as treasury, barracks and more.<br>Place torches to light the way forward.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dig to explore</h2><br><span class=\"bb_